          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149346,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Most of the semantic elements so far didn't change the look of the web page, but now we'll get to know some that do.</p><p>We'll replace the <code>p</code> with these alternatives, which make the code more readable while changing the look of the page.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Quest of the Day&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/scream.png&quot; width=&quot;220&quot; height=&quot;277&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Shadow Wraith&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Defeat the wraith to earn bonus XP.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Watch out for its dash attack during phase two.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149347,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You might have noticed that some semantic elements, like <code>h1</code> aren't only more readable, but also change the look of the rendered page.<br /></p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest of the Day\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/scream.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;220&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;277&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"The Shadow Wraith\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Defeat the wraith to earn bonus XP.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Watch out for its dash attack during phase two.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/h1&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can indicate that some text is a detailed description by surrounding the entire content with <code>&lt;details&gt;&lt;/details&gt;</code>.</p><p>This element hides the text with a widget that must be toggled to view/hide again.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;div&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/div&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"148\" endIndex=\"157\" /><option startIndex=\"249\" endIndex=\"259\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Quest of the Day\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/scream.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;220&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;277&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"The Shadow Wraith\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" />